    "title": "CAL-03: CMB Log-Periodogram \u2014 Efimov/DSI Search in Planck 2018 Data",
    "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.21534747",
    "publication_date": "2026-07-24",
    "description": "Search for log-periodic oscillations in the Planck 2018 CMB TT power spectrum with periods ln(q) = 1 (Efimov, q = e) and ln(q) = ln(pi) = 1.14. Physically motivated by the Efimov effect and discrete scale invariance (DSI), independent of the retracted Harmonic Paradigm logistic beta-function mechanism. Includes both binned (83 bins) and full unbinned spectrum (2471 pts) analyses, with 200 LCDM+noise Monte Carlo simulations. Result: H0 NOT REJECTED \u2014 global MC p-value = 0.38, B95 &lt; 0.004 amplitude constraint. Contains 8 figures, 4 data files (including Planck 2018 full TT spectrum), 2 analysis pipelines, and full report. All data self-contained for reproducibility.",
